    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on the Hallandsåsen ridge north of Ängelholm, close to 190 m above sea level, and watches north-western Skåne, the Kattegat and the Öresund region. The station dates from 2001; its radar was renewed with dual-polarisation technology in 2015, early in SMHI's network upgrade."
